      ],
      "content": "TL 00 NE 8/313 ST MICHAEL WESTWICK ROW (north east side) King Charles II Cottage II House.  Late C17 or early C18.  Exposed timber frame.  Painted brick.  Plain tile roof.   2 bays.   2-storeyed structure with external stack on roadside gable end.  2 C20 leaded casements. Diagonal wall braces.   Interior has exposed unchamfered beams and joists, formerly with nailed ceiling boards.   C20 extension away from road. Listing NGR: TL0920606676"
    }
